{# Share links for WhatsApp, Telegram and e-mail.

   Plain links, no JavaScript and no third-party script, so nothing loads before
   a click. The deploy builds no storefront JavaScript, so navigator.share and a
   copy button are out of reach anyway.

   The page URL is the URL as it was requested, built from two attributes the
   RequestTransformer sets: sw-sales-channel-absolute-base-url is scheme and
   host, and sw-original-request-uri is the path as requested, including the
   domain path such as /de and the query string. Measured on 2026-10-06, the
   other candidates are wrong:

   - app.request.uri has the sales channel domain prefix stripped by the
     RequestTransformer, so on /de/ it shares the root.
   - sw-storefront-url plus resolved-uri, which ChimodiazzTheme uses, gives the
     technical /navigation/<id> path on sdwa5.org/About-SdWa5/ and drops the
     trailing slash on sdwa5.org/de/Hardware/, which then answers 404.
   - page.metaInformation.canonical is a placeholder that the SEO URL handler
     replaces in the finished response, and |url_encode breaks the pattern it
     looks for. It is also missing on several pages.

   app.request.uri stays the fallback for error pages, where the
   RequestTransformer does not run.

   Variables: sdwa5ShareVariant is 'bar' (fixed at the right edge from 992 px)
   or 'row' (end of the main content below 992 px). #}
{% set sdwa5Host = app.request.attributes.get('sw-sales-channel-absolute-base-url') %}
{% set sdwa5Path = app.request.attributes.get('sw-original-request-uri') %}
{% set sdwa5Url = sdwa5Host and sdwa5Path
    ? sdwa5Host ~ sdwa5Path
    : app.request.uri %}
{% set sdwa5Text = 'sdwa5.share.text'|trans %}

<aside class="sdwa5-share sdwa5-share--{{ sdwa5ShareVariant }}" aria-label="{{ 'sdwa5.share.label'|trans|striptags }}">
    <span class="sdwa5-share__label">{{ 'sdwa5.share.label'|trans|sw_sanitize }}</span>

    <a class="sdwa5-share__link"
       href="https://wa.me/?text={{ (sdwa5Text ~ ' ' ~ sdwa5Url)|url_encode }}"
       target="_blank"
       rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a>

    <a class="sdwa5-share__link"
       href="https://t.me/share/url?url={{ sdwa5Url|url_encode }}&amp;text={{ sdwa5Text|url_encode }}"
       target="_blank"
       rel="noopener noreferrer">Telegram</a>

    <a class="sdwa5-share__link"
       href="mailto:?subject={{ sdwa5Text|url_encode }}&amp;body={{ (sdwa5Text ~ ' ' ~ sdwa5Url)|url_encode }}">{{ 'sdwa5.share.email'|trans|sw_sanitize }}</a>
</aside>
